Feed Chef vendors the following MIT-licensed sentiment engines.

VADER Sentiment Analysis
  https://github.com/cjhutto/vaderSentiment
  Copyright (c) 2016 C.J. Hutto
  See vendor/vader/LICENSE.txt

LeIA — Léxico para Inferência Adaptada
  https://github.com/rafjaa/LeIA
  Portuguese adaptation (fork) of VADER for social-media text. Its
  LICENSE.txt is the VADER MIT licence text, naming C.J. Hutto as the
  copyright holder; it names no other holder.
  See vendor/leia/LICENSE.txt

Neither package is installed from PyPI; sources and lexicons are copied
into this tree. The optional VADER translation demo (requests) was removed.
